IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Davvero? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Non sai proprio cosa
ti perdi! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}Beh, pace, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
